  <item>
    <title>S2E6 朋友，哪怕我们渐行渐远，也别忘了曾经的美好</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ebd86d0decaeb09443d1d1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67ebd86d0decaeb09443d1d1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 01 Apr 2025 12:18:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>每个阶段都会交新朋友的阿猴</span></p><span></span><p><span>每个阶段都留有三两好友的鸭鸭</span></p><span></span><p><span>【简单唠唠】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vol.011</span></p><span></span><p><span>小时候，我们一起上学放学，一起在课间相约厕所，我们告诉彼此，我们要做一辈子好朋友。</span></p><span></span><p><span>可那时年岁尚小，哪知道一辈子这么长。</span></p><span></span><p><span>后来我们毕业了，天各一方，我们走上了截然不同的人生道路，共同话题也越来越少。</span></p><span></span><p><span>许久不见，我们不再打打闹闹，竟也像成年人那般客套寒暄。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那一刻我明白，你在我的人生旅途里，杀青了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>若是相忘于江湖，我希望你能珍藏属于我们的回忆，并真心地祝福你，往后余生一切顺遂。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但我依然期待，再见的那天。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期剧透】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">02:27</a> 当友情变得无话可说，我们将如何定义彼此？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="427">07:07</a> 打工人匮乏的社交能量，也许是击垮友情的原因之一；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 谁会在友情里当舔狗啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1026">17:06</a> 长久友情的链接，是共同爱好还是共同成长？；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1487">24:47</a> 适当袒露脆弱，有助于维系友情；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1786">29:46</a> 当朋友变得越来越客气，也许是和平分手的前兆。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【背景音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《笑忘歌》—五月天</span></p><span></span><p><span>【幕后团队】</span></p><span></span><p><span>单集封面：鸭鸭</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案/剪辑：阿猴</span></p><span></span><p><span>真是辛苦大家了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：猴鸭空间</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：吃月亮的冰</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：ducky_monkey@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/641b21be7f096f267775be49/lulZ5qP2cBTAqRBKzl5E-52C67yo.m4a" length="72392021" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg-OJI9kwAHoeDrOhY7JcBglI3JX.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>S2E5 2月复盘 | 焦虑的反义词是具体</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d9620fdd11f9c8c170fe89</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d9620fdd11f9c8c170fe89</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Mar 2025 12:19:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>把健身频率拉满了的阿猴</span></p><span></span><p><span>复工之后状态极佳的鸭鸭</span></p><span></span><p><span>【简单唠唠】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vol.010</span></p><span></span><p><span>过完立春，期待中的回暖并没有降临，反倒是一波倒春寒，让我们穿上了压箱底的厚棉衣。</span></p><span></span><p><span>临近月底，久违的阳光终于有了迹象。</span></p><span></span><p><span>对于鸭鸭而言，2月的关键词是假期、旅游和复工，而对于我来说，2月的关键词是健身、秩序和情绪波动。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们仍然时不时焦虑迷茫，但我们也在用具体的事情填满生活，试图抵抗。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这个过程注定漫长而枯燥，就像西西弗斯不停推动的巨石，随时都有跌落的风险。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但还是得向前看，不是吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期剧透】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> 滴！欢迎收听我们的2月计划完成情况汇报；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> 健身的第7年，最明显的健身痕迹不能是茧子吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 西双版纳游记——累但有钱赚的家庭旅行；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1562">26:02</a> 也许旅游的意义就是逃离；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1774">29:34</a> 面对无处不在的焦虑，我们只能把握当下；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2387">39:47</a> 开年2个月，年度预算计划就过半啦？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【背景音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《低潮期》—丁世光/叶喜儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>【幕后团队】</span></p><span></span><p><span>单集封面：鸭鸭</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案/剪辑：阿猴</span></p><span></span><p><span>真是辛苦大家了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【相关链接】</span></p><span></span><p><span>文字版：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/1hmJbWDBTKD6VmK84ksNKw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/1hmJbWDBTKD6VmK84ksNKw"><span>推动西西弗斯的巨石｜Feb.</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：猴鸭空间</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：吃月亮的冰</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：ducky_monkey@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
